# ST. BENEDICT'S EARLY YEARS BRITISH ACADEMY
## Complete School Website & Management System

### Version: 1.0.0
### Release Date: 2024

## Overview

A comprehensive, production-ready school management system with public website and secure portal for administrators, teachers, students, and parents. Built with HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, PHP (OOP), and MySQL.

## Features

### Public Website
- Responsive design (mobile-first)
- Complete branding with navy blue, red, and gold
- Home page with hero section, mission, news preview
- About Us with history, leadership, facilities
- Admissions with online application form
- Academics curriculum overview
- News & Events with dynamic posts
- Gallery with image management
- Contact page with map and form

### Management Portal
- Role-based access (Admin, Teacher, Student, Parent)
- Secure authentication with CSRF protection
- Dashboard with statistics and charts
- Student management (CRUD, promotion, photo upload)
- Teacher management with subject assignment
- Class and subject management
- Attendance tracking with reports
- Fee management with receipts
- Results management with PDF reports
- Communication system (announcements, messages)
- Gallery management
- Audit logs
- Export to Excel/CSV

### Security Features
- Password hashing (bcrypt)
- Prepared statements (PDO)
- CSRF tokens
- XSS prevention
- SQL injection prevention
- Session security
- File upload validation
- Account lockout
- Activity logging
- HTTPS ready

## System Requirements

### Server Requirements
- PHP 7.4 or higher
- MySQL 5.7 or higher
- Apache/Nginx web server
- SSL Certificate
- 2GB RAM minimum
- 20GB disk space

### PHP Extensions Required
- PDO PHP Extension
- MySQLi PHP Extension
- OpenSSL PHP Extension
- GD PHP Extension
- FileInfo PHP Extension
- JSON PHP Extension
- cURL PHP Extension
- ZIP PHP Extension
- mbstring PHP Extension

## Installation Guide

### 1. Download & Extract
Download the system and extract to your web root directory.

### 2. Create Database
```sql
CREATE DATABASE st_benedicts_academy CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;